{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/extras/6c68e633c55cab42bd2c8f9662d8aaee.poster.avif?t=1751710713\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/extras/6c68e633c55cab42bd2c8f9662d8aaee.webm?t=1751710713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/extras/6c68e633c55cab42bd2c8f9662d8aaee.mp4?t=1751710713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly destroyed, a delicate but highly advanced robot awakens to a city in crisis. A dominating robotics manufacturer has disappeared in the midst of addressing a dangerous malfunction in their models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What caused all this destruction? And can it be stopped?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What will you become to find out?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique movement mechanics allow a broken city to become your playground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take advantage of your small size and parasitic abilities to get the upper hand on challenging enemy encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve innovative puzzles by redirecting power sources and manipulating the abilities of different robots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clear your way across diverse levels ranging from deserted industrial sites to luxury office complexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677860/extras/f639826574922f592649e2e7aed848f6.poster.avif?t=1751710713\" ><source src=\"ht